(* Correctly rejected by the typechecker: the case of ReadImu waits 0.6 ms,
   within the bounds of its running time, in place of the reading. A delay
   is not the operation, which the grade demands:

     Typing error: Variable `k` is unboxed with grade `[{0.6}, {0.6}]`
       accumulated since it was bound, which is not below its box grade
       `[{ReadImu}, {ReadImu}]`
       ...
       Note: the resource inequality
         `[{0.6}, {0.6}] <= [{ReadImu}, {ReadImu}]` does not hold
*)
(*
