(* Correctly rejected by the typechecker: the case of ReadImu delays the
   reading by 2 ms, so that the case may take 3.25 ms, beyond the upper
   bound of 1.25 ms of the running time of ReadImu. Under these grades a
   delay of any length after the operation is rejected, its trace not being
